{
  "name": "roslyn-sense",
  "displayName": "RoslynSense",
  "description": "C# language server backed by the RoslynSense shared daemon \u2014 the same loaded solution your MCP-connected AI assistant uses.",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "publisher": "roslyn-sense",
  "license": "MIT",
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.85.0"
  },
  "categories": [
    "Programming Languages",
    "Debuggers",
    "Testing"
  ],
  "activationEvents": [
    "onLanguage:csharp",
    "onLanguage:webforms",
    "onLanguage:resx",
    "onLanguage:proto",
    "workspaceContains:**/*.{sln,slnx,csproj}"
  ],
  "main": "./out/extension.js",
  "contributes": {
    "languages": [
      {
        "id": "cs-embedded",
        "aliases": [
          "Embedded C#"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "webforms",
        "aliases": [
          "WebForms",
          "ASP.NET WebForms"
        ],
        "extensions": [
          ".aspx",
          ".ascx",
          ".master",
          ".asax",
          ".ashx",
          ".asmx"
        ],
        "firstLine": "^\\s*<%@",
        "configuration": "./language-configuration/webforms.json"
      },
      {
        "id": "resx",
        "aliases": [
          "RESX"
        ],
        "extensions": [
          ".resx"
        ],
        "configuration": "./language-configuration/resx.json"
      },
      {
        "id": "proto",
        "aliases": [
          "Protocol Buffers",
          "protobuf"
        ],
        "extensions": [
          ".proto"
        ],
        "configuration": "./language-configuration/proto.json"
      }
    ],
    "grammars": [
      {
        "language": "cs-embedded",
        "scopeName": "source.cs-embedded",
        "path": "./syntaxes/csharpEmbedded.tmLanguage.json"
      },
      {
        "language": "webforms",
        "scopeName": "text.html.webforms",
        "path": "./syntaxes/webforms.tmLanguage.json",
        "embeddedLanguages": {
          "text.html": "html",
          "source.cs-embedded": "cs-embedded",
          "source.sql": "sql",
          "text.xml": "xml",
          "source.js": "javascript",
          "source.json": "json",
          "source.css": "css"
        }
      },
      {
        "language": "resx",
        "scopeName": "text.xml.resx",
        "path": "./syntaxes/resx.tmLanguage.json"
      },
      {
        "language": "proto",
        "scopeName": "source.proto",
        "path": "./syntaxes/proto.tmLanguage.json"
      }
    ],
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.searchEverywhere",
        "title": "RoslynSense: Search Everywhere"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.openSolution",
        "title": "RoslynSense: Pick Solution"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.pinLaunchUrl",
        "title": "RoslynSense: Pin Launch URL to launchSettings.json"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.restartServer",
        "title": "RoslynSense: Restart Server"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.restorePackages",
        "title": "RoslynSense: Restore NuGet Packages"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.reloadRoslynWorkspace",
        "title": "RoslynSense: Reload Workspace"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.showProcesses",
        "title": "RoslynSense: Show Running Processes"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.runTest",
        "title": "RoslynSense: Run Test"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.showReferences",
        "title": "RoslynSense: Show References"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.openLocation",
        "title": "RoslynSense: Open Location"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.showInheritance",
        "title": "RoslynSense: Show Inheritance"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.showDebugSession",
        "title": "RoslynSense: Show AI Debug Session"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.openAiDebugSession",
        "title": "RoslynSense: Open AI Debug Session in Debugger"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.pickProcess",
        "title": "RoslynSense: Pick .NET Process"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.refresh",
        "title": "Refresh",
        "category": "RoslynSense",
        "icon": "$(refresh)"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.showAllFiles",
        "title": "Show All Files",
        "category": "RoslynSense",
        "icon": "$(eye-closed)"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.hideNonProjectFiles",
        "title": "Show Project Items Only",
        "category": "RoslynSense",
        "icon": "$(eye)"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.showIgnored",
        "title": "Show Ignored Folders",
        "category": "RoslynSense"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.hideIgnored",
        "title": "Hide Ignored Folders",
        "category": "RoslynSense"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.revealActiveFile",
        "title": "Toggle: Always Select Opened File",
        "category": "RoslynSense",
        "icon": "$(target)"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.goToNode",
        "title": "Search Solution",
        "category": "RoslynSense",
        "icon": "$(search)"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.revealInExplorer",
        "title": "Reveal in File Explorer",
        "category": "RoslynSense"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.findInFolder",
        "title": "Find in Folder",
        "category": "RoslynSense"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.openProjectFile",
        "title": "Edit Project File",
        "category": "RoslynSense"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.buildProject",
        "title": "Build Project",
        "category": "RoslynSense",
        "icon": "$(tools)"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.manageNuGet",
        "title": "Manage NuGet Packages",
        "category": "RoslynSense",
        "icon": "$(package)"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.manageNuGetForProject",
        "title": "Manage NuGet Packages\u2026",
        "category": "RoslynSense"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.newFile",
        "title": "New File\u2026",
        "category": "RoslynSense",
        "icon": "$(new-file)"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.newFolder",
        "title": "New Folder\u2026",
        "category": "RoslynSense",
        "icon": "$(new-folder)"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.rename",
        "title": "Rename\u2026",
        "category": "RoslynSense"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.delete",
        "title": "Delete",
        "category": "RoslynSense"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.runWithHotReload",
        "title": "Run with Hot Reload",
        "category": "RoslynSense"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.applyHotReload",
        "title": "Apply Hot Reload",
        "category": "RoslynSense"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.stopHotReload",
        "title": "Stop Hot Reload Session",
        "category": "RoslynSense"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.copy",
        "title": "Copy",
        "category": "RoslynSense"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.cut",
        "title": "Cut",
        "category": "RoslynSense"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.paste",
        "title": "Paste",
        "category": "RoslynSense"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.duplicate",
        "title": "Duplicate",
        "category": "RoslynSense"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.newItem",
        "title": "New\u2026",
        "category": "RoslynSense"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.startupAndDebug",
        "title": "Set as Startup and Debug",
        "category": "RoslynSense"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.packageDetails",
        "title": "Package Details",
        "category": "RoslynSense"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.toggleFileNesting",
        "title": "Toggle File Nesting",
        "category": "RoslynSense",
        "icon": "$(list-tree)"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.runProject",
        "title": "Run Project",
        "category": "RoslynSense",
        "icon": "$(play)"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.debugProject",
        "title": "Debug Project",
        "category": "RoslynSense",
        "icon": "$(debug-alt)"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.newSolutionFolder",
        "title": "New Solution Folder",
        "category": "RoslynSense",
        "icon": "$(new-folder)"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.addProjectReference",
        "title": "Add Project Reference\u2026",
        "category": "RoslynSense",
        "icon": "$(references)"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.newProject",
        "title": "New Project\u2026",
        "category": "RoslynSense",
        "icon": "$(new-file)"
      }
    ],
    "viewsContainers": {
      "activitybar": [
        {
          "id": "roslynSense",
          "title": "RoslynSense",
          "icon": "media/solution.svg"
        }
      ]
    },
    "views": {
      "roslynSense": [
        {
          "id": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer",
          "name": "Solution",
          "contextualTitle": "Solution Explorer"
        }
      ]
    },
    "breakpoints": [
      {
        "language": "csharp"
      },
      {
        "language": "webforms"
      }
    ],
    "taskDefinitions": [
      {
        "type": "roslynsense",
        "required": [
          "task"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "task": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "build",
              "rebuild",
              "clean",
              "test",
              "watch"
            ],
            "description": "What to run."
          },
          "project": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Project or solution path. Omit for the whole solution."
          },
          "configuration": {
            "type": "string",
            "default": "Debug"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "jsonValidation": [
      {
        "fileMatch": "**/Properties/launchSettings.json",
        "url": "./schemas/launchSettings.schema.json"
      }
    ],
    "debuggers": [
      {
        "type": "roslynsense",
        "label": "C# (RoslynSense)",
        "languages": [
          "csharp"
        ],
        "configurationAttributes": {
          "launch": {
            "properties": {
              "projectPath": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Project to launch. Omit to be prompted."
              },
              "configuration": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Build configuration.",
                "default": "Debug"
              },
              "launchProfile": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "launchSettings.json profile to launch with. Omit to use the first Project profile."
              },
              "program": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Executable to launch. Resolved from the project when omitted."
              },
              "args": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "default": []
              },
              "cwd": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "env": {
                "type": "object",
                "default": {}
              },
              "stopAtEntry": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "default": false,
                "description": "Break at the program's entry point."
              },
              "justMyCode": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "default": true
              }
            }
          },
          "attach": {
            "properties": {
              "processId": {
                "type": [
                  "number",
                  "string"
                ],
                "description": "PID of the .NET process to attach to."
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "initialConfigurations": [
          {
            "type": "roslynsense",
            "request": "launch",
            "name": "C#: Launch"
          }
        ],
        "configurationSnippets": [
          {
            "label": "C#: Launch project (RoslynSense)",
            "description": "Build and debug a .NET project.",
            "body": {
              "type": "roslynsense",
              "request": "launch",
              "name": "C#: Launch",
              "projectPath": "^\"\\${workspaceFolder}/${1:Project}/${1:Project}.csproj\"",
              "stopAtEntry": false
            }
          },
          {
            "label": "C#: Attach to process (RoslynSense)",
            "description": "Attach the debugger to a running .NET process.",
            "body": {
              "type": "roslynsense",
              "request": "attach",
              "name": "C#: Attach",
              "processId": "^\"\\${command:roslynSense.pickProcess}\""
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "roslynsense-ai",
        "label": "RoslynSense AI Session",
        "languages": [
          "csharp"
        ],
        "configurationAttributes": {
          "attach": {
            "properties": {
              "ownerPid": {
                "type": "number",
                "description": "PID of the chat process owning the debug session. Omit to attach to the first one."
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "initialConfigurations": [
          {
            "type": "roslynsense-ai",
            "request": "attach",
            "name": "Attach to AI Debug Session"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "menus": {
      "commandPalette": [
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.runTest",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.showReferences",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.openLocation",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.copy",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.cut",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.paste",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.duplicate",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.newItem",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.startupAndDebug",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.packageDetails",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.runProject",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.debugProject",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.newSolutionFolder",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.addProjectReference",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.newProject",
          "when": "false"
        }
      ],
      "editor/context": [
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.showInheritance",
          "when": "editorLangId == csharp",
          "group": "navigation@50"
        }
      ],
      "view/title": [
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.showAllFiles",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && !roslynSense.showAllFiles",
          "group": "navigation@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.hideNonProjectFiles",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && roslynSense.showAllFiles",
          "group": "navigation@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.revealActiveFile",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer",
          "group": "navigation@3"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.refresh",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer",
          "group": "navigation@4"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.showIgnored",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && !roslynSense.showIgnored",
          "group": "1_toggles"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.hideIgnored",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && roslynSense.showIgnored",
          "group": "1_toggles"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.toggleFileNesting",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer",
          "group": "navigation@4"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.goToNode",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer",
          "group": "navigation@1"
        }
      ],
      "view/item/context": [
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.buildProject",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && viewItem =~ /^project(Runnable)?$/",
          "group": "inline@3"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.openProjectFile",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && viewItem =~ /^project(Runnable)?$/",
          "group": "1_edit"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.findInFolder",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && viewItem =~ /^(folder|project|projectRunnable|solutionFolder)$/",
          "group": "2_search"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.revealInExplorer",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && viewItem =~ /^(file|folder|project|projectRunnable)$/",
          "group": "3_os"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.manageNuGetForProject",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && viewItem =~ /^(project|projectRunnable|dependencies|packages)$/",
          "group": "1_edit"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.newFile",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && viewItem =~ /^(project|projectRunnable|folder)$/",
          "group": "2_modify@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.newFolder",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && viewItem =~ /^(project|projectRunnable|folder)$/",
          "group": "2_modify@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.rename",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && viewItem =~ /^(file|folder)$/",
          "group": "2_modify@3"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.delete",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && viewItem =~ /^(file|folder)$/",
          "group": "2_modify@4"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.newItem",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && viewItem =~ /^(project|projectRunnable|folder)$/",
          "group": "2_modify@0"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.cut",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && viewItem =~ /^(file|folder)$/",
          "group": "4_clipboard@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.copy",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && viewItem =~ /^(file|folder)$/",
          "group": "4_clipboard@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.paste",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && viewItem =~ /^(project|projectRunnable|folder|file)$/",
          "group": "4_clipboard@3"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.duplicate",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && viewItem == file",
          "group": "4_clipboard@4"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.startupAndDebug",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && viewItem == projectRunnable",
          "group": "1_edit@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.packageDetails",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && viewItem == package",
          "group": "1_edit"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.runProject",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && viewItem == projectRunnable",
          "group": "inline@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.debugProject",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && viewItem == projectRunnable",
          "group": "inline@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.newSolutionFolder",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && viewItem =~ /^(solution|solutionFolder)$/",
          "group": "2_modify@0"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.addProjectReference",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && viewItem =~ /^(dependencies|projects)$/",
          "group": "1_edit@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.newProject",
          "when": "view == roslynSense.solutionExplorer && viewItem =~ /^(solution|solutionFolder)$/",
          "group": "2_modify@1"
        }
      ]
    },
    "keybindings": [
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.searchEverywhere",
        "key": "ctrl+t",
        "mac": "cmd+t",
        "when": "!inQuickOpen"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.showInheritance",
        "key": "ctrl+alt+u",
        "when": "editorTextFocus && editorLangId == csharp"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.openProjectFile",
        "key": "alt+enter",
        "when": "focusedView == roslynSense.solutionExplorer"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.findInFolder",
        "key": "ctrl+shift+f",
        "when": "focusedView == roslynSense.solutionExplorer"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.buildProject",
        "key": "ctrl+shift+b",
        "when": "focusedView == roslynSense.solutionExplorer"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.goToNode",
        "key": "ctrl+t",
        "when": "focusedView == roslynSense.solutionExplorer"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.copy",
        "key": "ctrl+c",
        "mac": "cmd+c",
        "when": "focusedView == roslynSense.solutionExplorer"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.cut",
        "key": "ctrl+x",
        "mac": "cmd+x",
        "when": "focusedView == roslynSense.solutionExplorer"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.paste",
        "key": "ctrl+v",
        "mac": "cmd+v",
        "when": "focusedView == roslynSense.solutionExplorer"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.duplicate",
        "key": "ctrl+d",
        "mac": "cmd+d",
        "when": "focusedView == roslynSense.solutionExplorer"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.newItem",
        "key": "alt+insert",
        "when": "focusedView == roslynSense.solutionExplorer"
      },
      {
        "command": "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.startupAndDebug",
        "key": "f5",
        "when": "focusedView == roslynSense.solutionExplorer"
      }
    ],
    "configurationDefaults": {
      "[csharp]": {
        "editor.formatOnType": true
      },
      "workbench.list.defaultFindMode": "filter",
      "workbench.list.typeNavigationMode": "automatic"
    },
    "configuration": {
      "title": "RoslynSense",
      "properties": {
        "roslynSense.serverPath": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "roslyn-sense",
          "description": "Path to the roslyn-sense executable (dotnet tool). Defaults to 'roslyn-sense' on PATH."
        },
        "roslynSense.solutionPath": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "",
          "description": "Default solution for this workspace. When empty: a single found .sln/.slnx is used automatically, multiple prompt a picker (use 'RoslynSense: Pick Solution' to change), none lets the server resolve from the workspace folder."
        },
        "roslynSense.debuggerPath": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "",
          "description": "Path to netcoredbg. When empty, the server locates it (PATH, common install locations) and downloads it if needed."
        },
        "roslynSense.shareEditorContext": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "Tell connected AI chats which file and symbol you are looking at, so they can resolve 'this method' or 'this error'. Sends paths, the cursor position, the current selection, and diagnostics already visible in the editor \u2014 never whole file contents."
        },
        "roslynSense.trace.server": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "off",
            "messages",
            "verbose"
          ],
          "default": "off",
          "description": "Trace LSP communication between VSCode and roslyn-sense."
        },
        "roslynSense.hotReload.applyOnSave": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false,
          "description": "Apply saved C# edits to the running application without restarting it. Rude edits (signature changes, new generic methods) are reported instead and still need a restart."
        },
        "roslynSense.analyzerDiagnostics": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "Run the project's analyzers (StyleCop, Roslynator, in-house) for editor diagnostics. Off leaves compiler diagnostics only."
        },
        "roslynSense.codeStyleDiagnostics": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "Include Roslyn's built-in IDE code-style rules (IDE0xxx). These are the rules most likely to be noisy on a repo with no .editorconfig."
        },
        "roslynSense.analyzerTimeoutSeconds": {
          "type": "integer",
          "default": 15,
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 300,
          "description": "How long one document\u2019s analyzer pass may take before reporting what it has. A slow analyzer delays squiggles, never typing."
        },
        "roslynSense.workspaceDiagnostics": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "off",
            "openProjects",
            "solution"
          ],
          "enumDescriptions": [
            "Only files you have open report to Problems.",
            "Projects owning an open file, plus what they reference.",
            "The whole solution. Expensive on a large one."
          ],
          "default": "openProjects",
          "description": "How much of the solution is swept for the Problems panel."
        },
        "roslynSense.sourceLink": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "When navigating into a package or framework type, fetch the source it was compiled from if its PDB says where to get it. Off decompiles instead and never reaches the network. Downloads are checksum-verified against the PDB."
        },
        "roslynSense.languages.webforms": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "markdownDescription": "Language features for `.aspx`, `.ascx`, `.master` and their siblings: navigation between markup and code-behind, completion for server controls, and markup hits folded into find-references and rename. Off leaves these files to the grammar alone in this window; other windows and connected AI chats are unaffected, and `roslynsense.json` is what turns it off for the whole solution. Takes effect on reload."
        },
        "roslynSense.languages.resx": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "markdownDescription": "Language features for `.resx`: navigation from a generated designer property to the entry that produced it, and resource keys folded into find-references. Off leaves these files as plain XML in this window; other windows and connected AI chats are unaffected, and `roslynsense.json` is what turns it off for the whole solution. Takes effect on reload."
        },
        "roslynSense.languages.proto": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "markdownDescription": "Language features for `.proto`: navigation from a `service` or `rpc` to the C# that implements and calls it, references for messages, fields and enums, and a warning on a type reference that resolves to nothing. protoc's generated C# is treated as a pass-through, so it never appears as a definition or a usage. Off leaves these files to the grammar alone in this window; other windows and connected AI chats are unaffected, and `roslynsense.json` is what turns it off for the whole solution. Takes effect on reload."
        },
        "roslynSense.languages.mediator": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "markdownDescription": "Resolve `Send`, `Publish` and the generated mediator extension methods to the handler that runs, and count those calls as usages of the handler. Supports MediatR and Zapto.Mediator. Off leaves them resolving to the mediator interface in this window; other windows and connected AI chats are unaffected, and `roslynsense.json` is what turns it off for the whole solution. Takes effect on reload."
        },
        "roslynSense.solutionExplorer.fileNesting": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "Nest generated and companion files under the file they belong to (Form1.Designer.cs under Form1.cs)."
        },
        "roslynSense.fileNesting.rules": {
          "type": "object",
          "default": {},
          "additionalProperties": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "markdownDescription": "Extra nesting rules, in the same shape as `explorer.fileNesting.patterns` \u2014 for example `\"*.bicep\": \"${capture}.bicepparam\"`. Only a `*.ext` parent with `${capture}`-prefixed children is honoured; anything else is ignored."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "compile": "tsc -p ./",
    "watch": "tsc -watch -p ./",
    "dev": "npm run compile && node scripts/dev.mjs",
    "package": "vsce package"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "vscode-languageclient": "^9.0.1"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^20.0.0",
    "@types/vscode": "^1.85.0",
    "typescript": "^5.4.0"
  }
}
